## Main-agent window message patch (write boundary retained)

No window file was changed by this agent. In `gui/g4usim_gui/window/project.py::_show_snapshot_restore_notes`, replace the package-root scope key with:

```python
scope = ui_text(
    "Restored the current package's materials, geometry and main.ini source/physics/field/bias configuration. "
    "Run/scoring use recorded snapshot settings. Macro edits and historical run success were not restored."
)
```

The matching Chinese key is included in the latest core/j2_run_editors_i18n.json. This removes the old false statement that current hand-edited main source/physics was not restored. Central i18n import remains main-owned.
